            "value" : "Atur Bingkai…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All Clips" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Semua Klip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All caps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Huruf kapital"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All your clips in one place" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Semua klip Anda di satu tempat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An estimate of how well the opening hooks, how complete the story is and how shareable it is. Treat it as a hint, not a promise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perkiraan seberapa kuat pembukanya, seberapa utuh ceritanya, dan seberapa mudah dibagikan. Anggap sebagai petunjuk, bukan jaminan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animated keyword cards cut into the clip. Turn this off to leave them out of the preview and export." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kartu kata kunci beranimasi yang disisipkan ke klip. Matikan agar tidak muncul di pratinjau dan hasil ekspor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animation" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Animasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any OpenAI-compatible API, such as a gateway that serves many models. Uses your own base URL and key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "API apa pun yang kompatibel dengan OpenAI, misalnya gateway yang menyediakan banyak model. Memakai URL dasar dan kunci milik Anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AnyClip" : {},
    "AnyClip Can’t Open Your Library" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnyClip Tidak Dapat Membuka Pustaka Anda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AnyClip Tour" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tur AnyClip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AnyClip couldn’t see two speakers clearly enough in this clip — faces may be too small, turned away or covered by graphics — so it uses the full-frame layout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnyClip tidak bisa melihat dua pembicara dengan cukup jelas di klip ini — wajah mungkin terlalu kecil, berpaling, atau tertutup grafis — jadi klip ini memakai tata letak satu layar penuh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AnyClip downloads, transcribes, finds the best moments and frames them for you. It works in the background, so you can keep going." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnyClip mengunduh, mentranskripsi, menemukan momen terbaik, dan membingkainya untuk Anda. Semuanya berjalan di latar belakang, jadi Anda bisa tetap bekerja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AnyClip follows the main speaker automatically. Adjust Framing lets you place the crop yourself at any moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnyClip mengikuti pembicara utama secara otomatis. Dengan Atur Bingkai, Anda bisa menempatkan potongan sendiri kapan saja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AnyClip has no copy of this video. Create a new project from the original file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnyClip tidak memiliki salinan video ini. Buat proyek baru dari file aslinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AnyClip quit before this project finished." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnyClip tertutup sebelum proyek ini selesai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tampilan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence" : {},
    "Apple Intelligence (Private Cloud Compute)" : {},
    "Apple Intelligence (on this Mac)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence (di Mac ini)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence couldn’t read this clip (%@), so moments were picked from strong words in the transcript." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence tidak bisa membaca klip ini (%@), jadi momen dipilih dari kata-kata kuat di transkrip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence declined to write hooks for this clip. Try again, or choose another AI provider in Settings › AI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence menolak menulis hook untuk klip ini. Coba lagi, atau pilih penyedia AI lain di Pengaturan › AI."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence finds the best moments privately on this Mac. Prefer Gemini, OpenAI or another service? Add your own key in Settings › AI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence menemukan momen terbaik secara privat di Mac ini. Lebih suka Gemini, OpenAI, atau layanan lain? Tambahkan kunci Anda sendiri di Pengaturan › AI."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is reading… (%lld/%lld)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence sedang membaca… (%lld/%lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence isn’t available, so titles come from the speaker’s own words." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence tidak tersedia, jadi judul diambil dari ucapan pembicara sendiri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Speech Recognition" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pengenalan Suara Apple"
