          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag the frame to place it. Each move adds a keyframe at the playhead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seret bingkai untuk menempatkannya. Setiap gerakan menambah keyframe di posisi putar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag the handles to change where the clip starts and ends. They snap to spoken words, so sentences never get cut off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seret pegangan untuk mengubah awal dan akhir klip. Pegangan menempel ke kata yang diucapkan, jadi kalimat tidak pernah terpotong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to change where the clip ends. Hold Option to turn off snapping." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seret untuk mengubah akhir klip. Tahan Option untuk mematikan snap."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to change where the clip starts. Hold Option to turn off snapping." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seret untuk mengubah awal klip. Tahan Option untuk mematikan snap."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop to use this video" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lepas untuk memakai video ini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each line on its own marker strip, like a highlighted note." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap baris di atas strip penanda sendiri, seperti catatan yang distabilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each model is downloaded once and kept on this Mac. All of them understand Indonesian, English and 90+ other languages." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap model diunduh sekali dan disimpan di Mac ini. Semuanya memahami bahasa Indonesia, Inggris, dan 90+ bahasa lainnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each video becomes a project here, with live progress while it works. Control-click a project to try again, show it in Finder or delete it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap video menjadi proyek di sini, lengkap dengan progres langsung saat diproses. Control-klik proyek untuk mencoba lagi, menampilkannya di Finder, atau menghapusnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit Words" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Edit Kata"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit caption text and style, rewrite the hook, adjust framing with keyframes and see why the clip was chosen. Export with ⌘E." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
