    "Open the video with this moment and play it from the start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buka video dengan momen ini dan putar dari awal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI’s Whisper running on this Mac. Often more accurate, especially for Indonesian and mixed languages. The model is downloaded once, then works offline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whisper dari OpenAI yang berjalan di Mac ini. Sering lebih akurat, terutama untuk bahasa Indonesia dan campuran bahasa. Modelnya diunduh sekali, lalu bisa dipakai offline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the video with a 2–3 second moment from later in the clip, then plays the clip from its start. The video gets that much longer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Membuka video dengan momen 2–3 detik dari bagian akhir klip, lalu memutar klip dari awal. Durasi video bertambah sepanjang itu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional, e.g. “money advice” or “funny moments”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opsional, misalnya “tips keuangan” atau “momen lucu”"
