    "Pick a caption style, add a hook title that grabs attention in the first seconds, and export everything automatically when it’s done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pilih gaya teks, tambahkan judul hook yang menarik perhatian di detik-detik pertama, dan ekspor semuanya otomatis saat selesai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick how many clips you want, how long they are and their format. Keep faces in frame follows the speaker, and Focus tells the AI what to look for." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pilih jumlah klip, durasi, dan formatnya. Jaga wajah tetap di bingkai akan mengikuti pembicara, dan Fokus memberi tahu AI apa yang harus dicari."
          }
