    "Text" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text on a rounded card. Clean and easy to read on any video." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teks di atas kartu membulat. Rapi dan mudah dibaca di video apa pun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The WhisperKit model couldn’t be downloaded. Check your internet connection and try again. (%@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Model WhisperKit tidak bisa diunduh. Periksa koneksi internet lalu coba lagi. (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The YouTube transcript couldn’t be read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transkrip YouTube tidak bisa dibaca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clip and your edits to it are removed from AnyClip. A video you already exported stays in your export folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klip dan hasil edit Anda dihapus dari AnyClip. Video yang sudah diekspor tetap ada di folder ekspor Anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download finished but no video file was found." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unduhan selesai tetapi file video tidak ditemukan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded video, transcript and clips are permanently removed from AnyClip. Exported clips stay in your export folder unless you choose to delete them too — they’re moved to the Trash." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Video yang diunduh, transkrip, dan klip dihapus permanen dari AnyClip. Klip yang sudah diekspor tetap di folder ekspor, kecuali Anda memilih menghapusnya juga — klip itu dipindahkan ke Tong Sampah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hook title says the same thing as this teaser." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Judul hook mengatakan hal yang sama dengan teaser ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key couldn’t be saved in your Keychain: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kunci tidak dapat disimpan di Keychain Anda: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key isn’t allowed to use this model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kunci ini tidak diizinkan memakai model ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library file may be damaged. You can start with an empty library — the old file is kept in AnyClip’s folder so it isn’t lost — or quit and restore it from a backup.\n\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "File pustaka mungkin rusak. Anda dapat memulai dengan pustaka kosong — file lama disimpan di folder AnyClip agar tidak hilang — atau keluar dan memulihkannya dari cadangan.\n\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The preview didn’t show any video. Other apps may be using the Mac’s video decoders, or the source file is damaged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pratinjau tidak menampilkan video. Mungkin app lain sedang memakai dekoder video Mac, atau file sumbernya rusak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project page tells you when this happens and why %@ failed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halaman proyek akan memberi tahu bila ini terjadi dan kenapa %@ gagal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project stops with the error from %@. Choose Try Again after fixing it — the video and transcript are reused." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Proyek berhenti dengan pesan error dari %@. Pilih Coba Lagi setelah diperbaiki — video dan transkrip dipakai ulang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project was stopped before it finished." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Proyek dihentikan sebelum selesai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The published checksum for %@ couldn’t be found, so it wasn’t installed. Try again later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Checksum yang dipublikasikan untuk %@ tidak ditemukan, jadi tidak diinstal. Coba lagi nanti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site refused the download. Try again in a minute, update yt-dlp in Settings › Downloads, or turn on browser cookies there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Situs menolak unduhan. Coba lagi sebentar lagi, perbarui yt-dlp di Pengaturan › Unduhan, atau aktifkan cookie browser di sana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source file has no video track." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "File sumber tidak memiliki trek video."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speaker shows strong feeling here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pembicara menunjukkan perasaan yang kuat di sini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stacked layout is available in the 9:16 format." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tata letak bertumpuk tersedia dalam format 9:16."
